s%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/>Call Us Now</button><a href=\"tel:+91 88797 32594\" class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] w-[214px] font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px]  min-h-[50px] sm:hidden flex items-center justify-center gap-2\"><img alt=\"Call icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fcall.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/>Call Us Now</a><a href=\"/service-area\"><button class=\"max-sm:w-[100%] border border-light-blue cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-secondary hover:bg-[#00234c] text-light-blue rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Visit Our Store</button></a></div></div></section><div class=\"flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-4 md:py-5 border-b border-gray-200 px-4\"><a class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Home</a><img alt=\"Arrow Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><a class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-gray-700 font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors\" href=\"/services\">Services</a><img alt=\"Arrow Icon\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 2x\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Ficons%2Fright-icon.svg&amp;w=48&amp;q=75\"/><span class=\"text-lg font-semibold text-primary font-medium\">Second Hand Laptops</span></div><section class=\"bg-white p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row false items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">Why Buy Second Hand</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">Get More Value for Your Money</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">Why pay full price when you can get a quality laptop for a fraction of the cost? At RN Infotech, we offer a wide selection of thoroughly tested and verified second-hand laptops — so you get great performance without stretching your budget.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\">Every laptop we sell goes through a rigorous quality check by our expert technicians before it reaches you. From students needing a reliable study companion to professionals looking for a work laptop on a budget — we have the right device for everyone.</p></div></p></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-21.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-section-bg p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:flex-row-reverse items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">Who It&#x27;s For</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">The Perfect Laptop for Every Need</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Students: </span>Affordable and reliable laptops for study, assignments and online classes. Great performance without burning a hole in your pocket.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Professionals: </span>Need a dependable work laptop on a budget? We have a range of tested and verified laptops suited for everyday professional use.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Businesses: </span>Looking to equip your team without overspending? We offer bulk second-hand laptops for businesses at highly competitive prices.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Charging Port Repair:</span> <!-- -->Laptop not charging properly? We diagnose and fix all charging port issues quickly.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Motherboard Repair:</span> We diagnose and repair complex motherboard issues for all major laptop brands.</p></div></p></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-60.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row false items-center gap-10 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-center xl:items-start gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center lg:text-left items-center lg:items-start\"><p class=\"label font-semibold text-center md:text-left tracking-widest\">Our Promise</p><h2 class=\"text-center lg:text-start max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-serif sm:text-3xl max-[380px]:leading-12 leading-13 sm:leading-11 lg:leading-16\">Why Buy Your Second Hand Laptop from RN Infotech?</h2></div><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Thoroughly Tested: </span>Every laptop is rigorously tested and verified by our expert technicians before sale. No surprises — just quality.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Honest Pricing: </span>We offer fair and transparent pricing on all our second-hand laptops. No hidden costs, no gimmicks.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Trusted Since 1990: </span>With over 30 years in the business, RN Infotech is a name Mumbai trusts. Buy with complete confidence.</p><p class=\"font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-lg 2xl:text-xl text-start font-sans\"><span class=\"font-semibold\">Exchange Available: </span>Have an old laptop? Exchange it for a second-hand or new one. Visit our store and get the best deal.</p></div></p></div><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[300px] sm:h-[400px] lg:h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"Service Detail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-66.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-gray-50 max-[380px]:px-5 p-8 lg:py-12 lg:px-16 2xl:px-50\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 md:gap-12 items-center\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 text-center items-center\"><p class=\"label font-semibold\">? FAQs</p><h2 class=\"italic max-[380px]:text-2xl text-h2 md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl  font-serif sm:text-3xl text-center max-[380px]:leading-11 leading-14\">Second Hand Laptops — Frequently Asked Questions</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8 lg:gap-12 w-full items-start\"><div class=\"w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Are the second-hand laptops tested before sale?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Yes, every laptop goes through a thorough quality check by our expert technicians before it is put up for sale. We ensure all laptops are in good working condition.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Do second-hand laptops come with a warranty?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Yes, we provide a warranty on our second-hand laptops. Please visit our store or call us for details on warranty terms and conditions.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Can I exchange my old laptop?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Yes, we accept old laptops for exchange. Visit our store and our team will assess your device and offer you the best deal possible.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">What laptop brands do you have available?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">We stock a wide range of brands including Dell, HP, Lenovo, Acer, Asus and more. Availability may vary so we recommend calling us or visiting the store for the latest stock.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Do you offer bulk laptops for businesses?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Yes, we offer bulk second-hand laptops for businesses at competitive prices. Contact us directly for bulk pricing and availability.</p></div></div><div class=\"border-b border-gray-300 py-4 md:py-5 cursor-pointer\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center gap-4\"><p class=\"font-extralight font-serif max-[380px]:text-sm max-[380px]:leading-8 text-lg leading-10 md:text-xl md:leading-12  text-gray-800\">Can I get a demo before buying?</p><div class=\"flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 md:w-10 md:h-10 rounded-full bg-primary flex items-center justify-center transition-transform duration-300\"><span class=\"text-white text-xl font-light leading-none\">+</span></div></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out max-h-0 opacity-0\"><p class=\"mt-3 font-sans max-[380px]:text-sm text-base md:text-lg text-gray-800 max-[380px]:leading-5 leading-relaxed pr-8\">Absolutely! You are welcome to visit our store and test the laptop before making a purchase. We encourage you to inspect the device thoroughly.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"hidden lg:block w-full lg:w-1/2\"><div class=\"relative w-full h-[480px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"FAQ Image\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Frn-infotech-23.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-center w-full sm:w-auto\"><a href=\"/contact\"><button class=\"py-1 cursor-pointer font-serif  font-extralight text-[12px] bg-primary hover:bg-[#43b1f5] text-secondary rounded-full px-8 transition-all ease-in-out duration-300 min-w-[200px] md:min-w-[220px] min-h-[50px]\">Still Have Questions? Contact Us</button></a></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[url(&#x27;/images/rn-infotech-59.webp&#x27;)] flex flex-col ite